title: "Orbit-Tied Quantized Neural Belief Propagation for Sliding-Window Decoding of Bivariate-Bicycle Codes"
abstract: "Official implementation, PyTorch neural BP training engine, and synthesizeable SystemVerilog hardware co-design for 3D sliding-window neural belief propagation decoding of bivariate-bicycle LDPC quantum codes under circuit-level noise."
